    "detailed_description": "Creates 3D VR scenes from 2D input using depth estimation machine learning model.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTakes any images or videos, estimates the depth using MiDaS model, and draws it in the 3D space for your VR HMD! <br />\r\nYou can save the depthmap output to use it later, record a 3D VR video to upload on Youtube. This program also can fetch the screen of your desktop and show the depth.",
